ns worse. Estimates only.</p></div></div></section></section><section class=\"print-break rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card sm:p-6\" aria-label=\"Pricing insights\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold sm:text-lg\">Pricing insights</h2><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col divide-y divide-line\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 py-3 first:pt-0 last:pb-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"font-medium\">The discount raises your menu price</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Without the 10% discount, the same margin needs only ₹285.71 instead of ₹333.76. Keep discounts for slow hours or first orders.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 py-3 first:pt-0 last:pb-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"font-medium\">You keep 59% of each rupee of price</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">That&#x27;s what&#x27;s left of the selling price after discount, commission + 18% GST, and ads. It&#x27;s the number every price is divided by.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 py-3 first:pt-0 last:pb-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"font-medium\">Never list below break-even</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">At ₹220.53 this dish earns ₹0 after deductions and costs. Any lower and every order loses money.</p></div></li></ul><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-muted-light\">Estimates based on the numbers you entered. Not a guarantee of results.</p></section><section aria-labelledby=\"formula-title\" class=\"print-break rounded-2xl border border-line bg-inverse p-6 text-on-inverse sm:p-8\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-accent-bright\">Formula</p><h2 id=\"formula-title\" class=\"mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-on-inverse\">How the numbers are calculated</h2><dl class=\"mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Total cost</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Dish cost + Labour + Packaging cost</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">factor</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">(1 − Discount) × (1 − Ads − 1.18 × Commission) − Margin</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Break-even price</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Total cost ÷ factor, with Margin = 0</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">Recommended price</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">Total cost ÷ factor at your margin (exact, not rounded)</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-on-inverse/5 p-4\"><dt class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-inverse/60\">If factor ≤ 0</dt><dd class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse\">No price can cover costs at this margin</dd></div></dl></section><section aria-labelledby=\"learn-title\" class=\"print-break\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-accent-dark\">Learn</p><h2 id=\"learn-title\" class=\"mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold\">Understanding <!-- -->menu pricing</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">What is this?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">A way to set delivery-app prices from your real cost per order instead of copying competitors or guessing.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">How it works</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">It runs the Online Payout formula backwards. For every rupee of selling price, the discount comes off first, then commission plus 18% GST on it, then ads. What&#x27;s left is the factor. Dividing your total cost by it gives the price. GST the customer pays on food isn&#x27;t counted, because the platform collects and pays it.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Why it matters</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Dine-in prices copied onto delivery apps often lose money once discounts, commission, GST and ads are taken out. Pricing from cost fixes that.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-accent-soft/60 p-5\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-4 w-4 text-accent-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg> Worked example</h3><p class=\"tabular mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Dish ₹100 + Labour ₹15 + Packaging ₹15 = ₹130. With 10% discount, 25% commission and 5% ads, factor = 0.9 × (1 − 0.05 − 1.18 × 0.25) = 0.5895. Break-even = ₹130 ÷ 0.5895 = ₹220.53. For a 20% margin: ₹130 ÷ 0.3895 = ₹333.76. At ₹333.76 the payout is ₹196.75 and profit ₹66.75 (20%).</p></div><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Common mistakes</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Forgetting labour or packaging in the total cost.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Mixing up your packaging cost with the packaging charge to the customer.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Running a big discount on a dish priced for no discount.</li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Ways to improve</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Re-cost dishes whenever supplier prices change.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Check the Online Payout calculator to confirm the profit at your final price.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Keep discounts for slow hours so peak-hour prices stay profitable.</li></ul></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-muted\">Reference ranges are indicative, drawn from common industry practice. The right numbers for your outlet depend on format, city, cuisine and pricing.</p></section><section aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\" class=\"no-print\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\" class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"mt-5 divide-y divide-line rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card\"><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">Is the price rounded?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">No. The calculator shows the exact price. If you round it for your menu, round up, so you stay at or above your margin.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">Why is GST on commission fixed at 18%?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Platforms charge 18% GST on their commission. It isn&#x27;t something you choose, so it&#x27;s built in to avoid mistakes.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">What if it says no price can cover costs?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Your discount, commission and ads leave too little of each rupee to cover cost plus margin. Lower the discount, ads or margin.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">What is the break-even price?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-wash text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">The price at which the dish earns ₹0 after all deductions and costs. Selling below it loses money on every order.</p></details></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the price rounded?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The calculator shows the exact price. If you round it for your menu, round up, so you stay at or above your margin.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why is GST on commission fixed at 18%?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Platforms charge 18% GST on their commission. It isn't something you choose, so it's built in to avoid mistakes.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What if it says no price can cover costs?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Your discount, commission and ads leave too little of each rupee to cover cost plus margin. Lower the discount, ads or margin.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the break-even price?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The price at which the dish earns ₹0 after all deductions and costs. Selling below it loses money on every order.\"}}]}</script></section><section aria-labelledby=\"related-title\" class=\"no-print\"><h2 id=\"related-title\" class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Related calculators</h2><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group relative flex h-full flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-line-strong hover:shadow-lift\" href=\"/restaurant/online-sale-payout-calculator\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-ink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></span></div><div><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold\">Online Payout &amp; Profit Calculator</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Payout and profit per order, step by step from selling price to profit.</p></div><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" aria-label=\"Key metrics\"><li class=\"rounded-md bg-wash px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-ink-soft\">Payout</li><li class=\"rounded-md bg-wash px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-ink-soft\">Profit per order</li><li class=\"rounded-md bg-wash px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-ink-soft\">Profit %</li><li class=\"rounded-md bg-wash px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-ink-soft\">Payout %</li></ul><span class=\"mt